BT /F2 14 Tf 0.15 0.35 0.65 rg 54 729.89 Td (1.1. Project Title & Real-World Context) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 705.89 Td (o  Project Title: AptechMart Multi Branch Online Supermarket System) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 690.89 Td (o  Academic Domain: Project 3 \(eProject\) Higher Diploma in Software Engineering) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 677.89 Td (   \(HDSE\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 662.89 Td (o  Institution: FPT Aptech Computer Education) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 641.89 Td (Real-World Business Context) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 54 626.89 Td (In the contemporary retail and digital commerce landscape, omnichannel grocery and) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 54 613.89 Td (supermarket chains operate complex networks of physical retail branches) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 54 600.89 Td (distributed across diverse districts and metropolitan regions. Traditional) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 54 587.89 Td (single-warehouse e-commerce platforms suffer from acute structural limitations) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 54 574.89 Td (when applied to supermarket chains:) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 558.89 Td (1. Inventory Location Mismatch \(Overselling & Logistics Lag\): In a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 545.89 Td (   single-inventory pool architecture, an online shopper in District A may) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 532.89 Td (   order items that are physically out of stock in the branch nearest to them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 519.89 Td (   Fulfilling the order requires cross-docking or shipping from a distant) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 506.89 Td (   warehouse, resulting in high logistics costs, long delivery delays, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 493.89 Td (   spoilage of perishable goods.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 478.89 Td (2. Pricing Disparity Across Branches: Operational expenditures, commercial) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 465.89 Td (   rent, and regional supplier agreements vary across physical locations. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 452.89 Td (   supermarket branch situated in a central metropolitan shopping district may) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 439.89 Td (   have different operating overheads and promotional pricing than a suburban) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 426.89 Td (   branch. Legacy platforms lack the capability to maintain branch-specific) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 413.89 Td (   selling prices on a unified product catalog.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 398.89 Td (3. Lack of Seamless Omnichannel Customer Choice: Customers increasingly expect) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 385.89 Td (   flexible fulfillment options: selecting between Store Pickup \(reserving) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 372.89 Td (   goods at a chosen supermarket branch and collecting them in person\) and Home) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 359.89 Td (   Delivery \(expedited shipping from the closest neighborhood branch\). Without) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 346.89 Td (   branch-aware inventory, customers cannot ascertain whether their local store) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 333.89 Td (   possesses the desired goods.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 312.89 Td (The AptechMart Solution) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 54 297.89 Td (AptechMart is designed from the ground up to overcome these challenges through an) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 54 284.89 Td (enterprise-grade Multi-Branch Inventory & Pricing Architecture:) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 268.89 Td (o  Global Catalog Foundation: A standardized, unified product hierarchy) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 255.89 Td (   \(`categories`, `brands`, `products`, `SKU`\) is maintained centrally.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 240.89 Td (o  Distributed Branch Inventory: Each physical supermarket branch \(`branches`\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 227.89 Td (   maintains independent inventory ledgers \(`branch_inventories`\) with isolated) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 214.89 Td (   selling prices \(`selling_price`\), on-hand stock \(`quantity_on_hand`\), reserved) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 201.89 Td (   allocations \(`reserved_quantity`\), available stock \(`available_quantity =) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 188.89 Td (   quantity_on_hand - reserved_quantity`\), and reorder thresholds) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 175.89 Td (   \(`reorder_level`\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 160.89 Td (o  Branch-Aware Cart & Atomic Stock Reservation: A customer's shopping cart) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 147.89 Td (   \(`carts`\) is bound to their selected physical supermarket branch. During) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 134.89 Td (   checkout, an atomic database transaction verifies stock availability and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 121.89 Td (   places an immediate reservation lock \(`reserved_quantity`\), completely) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 108.89 Td (   preventing race conditions and overselling.) Tj ET
