BT /F2 14 Tf 0.15 0.35 0.65 rg 54 787.89 Td (1.2. Project Objectives) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 763.89 Td (Business & Operational Objectives) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 748.89 Td (1. End-to-End Retail Journey: Provide a frictionless digital shopping) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 735.89 Td (   experience spanning localized product browsing, category filtering, branch) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 722.89 Td (   selection, side-by-side product comparison, branch-aware carts,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 709.89 Td (   transactional checkout, multi-gateway payments, and order tracking.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 694.89 Td (2. Multi-Gateway Payment Integration: Provide diverse, secure payment options) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 681.89 Td (   including Cash on Delivery \(COD\), VNPay Sandbox, and MoMo Sandbox with) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 668.89 Td (   tamper-proof HMAC-SHA512 signature verification and idempotent IPN callback) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 655.89 Td (   processing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 640.89 Td (3. Comprehensive Admin Portal: Empower supermarket store managers and corporate) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 627.89 Td (   administrators with tools to manage multi-tier category trees, brand) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 614.89 Td (   portfolios, product catalogs, branch pricing and stock levels, order status) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 601.89 Td (   lifecycle workflows, and customer accounts.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 580.89 Td (Technical & Architectural Objectives) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 565.89 Td (1. Clean Architecture & Domain-Driven Design: Strict layer separation across) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 552.89 Td (   Domain, Application, Infrastructure, and Presentation tiers to maximize) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 539.89 Td (   maintainability, testability, and enterprise extensibility.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 524.89 Td (2. Strict Concurrency & Data Integrity: Leverage database transaction scopes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 511.89 Td (   row-level locks, and native check constraints to guarantee that) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 498.89 Td (   `available_quantity` and `quantity_on_hand` never drop below zero, even) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 485.89 Td (   under heavy concurrent load.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 470.89 Td (3. Modern Identity & Token Security: Implement stateless JSON Web Token \(JWT\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 457.89 Td (   Bearer authentication coupled with Refresh Token Rotation \(RTR\) to ensure) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 444.89 Td (   high security and mitigate replay/theft attacks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 429.89 Td (4. Automated Verification: Complete automated testing covering Domain Unit) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 416.89 Td (   Tests, Infrastructure Integration Tests, Minimal API Endpoint Tests, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 403.89 Td (   Frontend Vitest suites.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 388.89 Td (5. Containerized Deployment: Single-command orchestrations via Docker Compose) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 64 375.89 Td (   ensuring identical staging, evaluation, and production environments.) Tj ET
