0.8 0.85 0.9 RG 0.75 w 54 710.89 m 541.28 710.89 l S
BT /F2 14 Tf 0.15 0.35 0.65 rg 54 693.89 Td (7.7. Common Troubleshooting & Solutions) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 669.89 Td (| Issue / Error | Root Cause | Solution / Fix |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 657.89 Td (| **Port 3306 or 8080 in use** | Existing local MySQL or web server already bound to port. | Stop conflicting service \(`net stop mysql`\) or adjust host port mapping in `compose.yaml`. |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 645.89 Td (| **DB connection failed on startup** | API container starts before MySQL finishes initialization. | `compose.yaml` includes `depends_on` with `condition: service_healthy`. For native dev, wait for MySQL service to start. |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 633.89 Td (| **409 Conflict during checkout** | Requested item quantity exceeds available stock \(`on_hand - reserved`\). | Expected business invariant behavior. Replenish inventory via Admin Portal or reduce cart quantity. |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 621.89 Td (| **401 Unauthorized on API calls** | JWT token expired \(15-min lifetime\). | Refresh token via `POST /api/auth/refresh` or log in again. |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 609.89 Td (| **CORS errors in browser console** | Frontend origin not present in API CORS whitelist. | Verify `appsettings.json` `Cors:AllowedOrigins` contains `http://localhost:5173`. |) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.4 0.4 0.4 rg 54 809.89 Td (AptechMart Multi Branch Online Supermarket System | Final eProject Report) Tj 0 0 0 rg ET
